claim.claim-text:
receiving, by a first server of a secure multi-party computation (MPC) system and from an application of a user device, a digital component request comprising contextual data and at least a first secret share of user data for a user of the user device;
sending, by the first server and to a content platform, a contextual request comprising the contextual data;
receiving, from the content platform, a first set of selection values for a first set of digital components;
performing, by the first server in collaboration with one or more second servers of the secure MPC system, an MPC selection process that is configured to:
select, from among the first set of digital components and a second set of digital components for which selection values are stored by the secure MPC system, a particular digital component; and
generate, for each server of the MPC system, a respective secret share of a selection result, the selection result comprising data identifying the particular digital component; and
